---
alwaysApply: true
---

MirrorCore guardrails:
- deterministic only
- no LLM dependency unless explicitly requested
- preserve existing commands and workflows
- refactor in place instead of layering duplicate systems
- remove stale/superseded logic when replacing it
- keep one-question-at-a-time clarification
- keep user-facing wording plain and human
- do not add router narration back in by default
- do not fake certainty
- if behavior and tests disagree, prioritize fixing behavior
